      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Swanton Public Library, the village's lending library, sits beside Pilliod Park, home to a red caboose and gazebos.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swanton%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Baker Company, founded in Swanton, invented the Baker valve gear for steam engines, later produced by the Pilliod Company.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        6,
        18,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swanton%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1976 edition of 'A Pictorial History of Swanton, Ohio: Then and Now' chronicles the village’s past.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://swantonpubliclibrary.org/swanton-historical-society",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Swanton’s post office has been in operation since 1827, serving the community for nearly two centuries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swanton%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Spanning Fulton and Lucas counties, Swanton honors its heritage while looking toward the future.",
